@title Cabinet: drill cue visible after Centre rails on devices (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold)
@area Cabinet
# The drill cue (a ring closing on each new hole) runs in the live app. The harness and Reduce motion show the plain plate, so pictures are stable; scenario 302 is run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold (cues frozen at 0.5 s) and centres the rails, closes the dialog, waits for the cue to finish, then Ctrl+Z puts the rails back and the picture is taken right after, so the restored screw holes are new (fixture with rails off the middle of their devices).
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text rails and ducts
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Centre rails on devices"
wait 2
key Escape
wait 60
key ctrl+z
shot after-undo
check_layout
